 85.5 0 112v352c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V306.2c0-10.7-12.9-16-20.5-8.5l-40 40c-2.2 2.3-3.5 5.3-3.5 8.5z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-edit icons\"></i> --> Edit Insert</a> <a class=\"btn btn-lg addbut\" href=\"workflow/15332\"><svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-list-alt fa-w-16 icons\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-fa-processed=\"\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"list-alt\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M464 480H48c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48V80c0-26.51 21.49-48 48-48h416c26.51 0 48 21.49 48 48v352c0 26.51-21.49 48-48 48zM128 120c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm0 96c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm0 96c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm288-136v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12zm0 96v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12zm0 96v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-list-alt icons\"></i> --> Insert Workflow</a><br><br><div class=\"whitebar\"><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><h2>Smuggling Sperm </h2></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 text-right\"><strong>By: <a href=\"user-view/63\">Paula Slier</a> | Delivery</strong></div></div><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><br><div class=\"col-sm-9 inspadd\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Proposal</h3><br><span class=\"headin\">Show:</span> Carte Blanche<br><br><span class=\"headin\">One Liner (Tonight on Carte Blanche...):</span><br>Palestinian political prisoners are smuggling sperm out of Israeli jails so their wives can give birth<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Summary: </span><br>Around 7,000 Palestinians are serving time in Israeli prisons, with nearly 1,000 of them facing sentences of 20 years or more. Denied conjugal visits and separated from visitors by glass panels, sneaking sperm samples out is their only hope to make a family.<br>\nMore than two dozen Palestinian children have been born to prisoner families in the past two years through a combination of sperm-smuggling and in vitro fertilisation (IVF). We meet families who've done this and speak with the Palestinian doctor who aides them.<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Case Study:</span><br><a href=\"case-study/15343\">Palestinian woman who has given birth to child conceived from smuggled sperm  </a><br><a href=\"case-study/15345\">Palestinian woman who has given birth to twins conceived from smuggled sperm  </a><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Expert:</span><br><a href=\"expert/15344\">Dr. Salem  Abu Khaizaran </a><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Hidden Camera:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Legal:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Graphics:</span> No<br></div><div class=\"col-sm-3\"><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Accept / Reject</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"headin\">Status:</span> <span class=\"app\">Approved</span><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Approved By:</span> Amalia Christoforou<br><span class=\"headin\">Approval Date:</span> 23 February 2015<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-footer\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Commission</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\"><span class=\"headin\">Commission Number:</span> 4513 <br><span class=\"headin\">Delivery Date:</span> Sunday, 01 March 2015<br><span class=\"headin\">Rate:</span> R7000<br><span class=\"headin\">Accept Contract:</span> I agree with the following <a href=\"cap-contractual-agreement/15332\">CAP Con